Detailed Solution:
NCERT Class 12 India: People and Economy (Chapter 4: Human Settlements, Functional Classification of Towns):
- Garrison/Cantonment towns: Ambala, Jalandhar, Babina, Mhow (A -> IV);
- Mining towns: Raniganj, Jharia, Digboi, Ankleshwar, Singrauli (B -> III);
- Industrial towns: Bhilai, Jamshedpur, Coimbatore, Rourkela, Modinagar (C -> I);
- Commercial towns: Kolkata, Saharanpur, Satna (specializing in trade and commerce) (D -> II).
This corresponds to (A)-(IV), (B)-(III), (C)-(I), (D)-(II).
Hence, option (C) is the correct match.

